/// A private certificate authority for workload identity (like AWS Private CA, step-ca or a SPIFFE server): tenant
/// certificate authorities whose signing keys are KMS keys, certificates issued from PKCS#10 requests with every
/// name decided by policy, SPIFFE workload certificates (SVIDs) for the caller's own identity, revocation, CRLs and
/// chain verification for mTLS. The API lives in api/pki.ts; the X.509 encoding in x509.ts.
/// TODO(port): a union or intersection type in TypeScript; JSON until ported.
pub type AuthorityState = Value;

